      "note": "Codes are the primary vehicle for Algerian systematic legislation (Code civil 1975, Code pénal 1966, Code de la famille 1984, Code du travail 1990, etc.). Model the code as the FRBR work of the founding ordonnance or loi; amendments are expressions or modifications of that work. Article numbering is continuous throughout, not prefixed with L./R. as in France."
    },
